{
    "title": "Drawing Carnival",
    "description": "Are you a fan of asmr coloring games and crayola pixel art drawing carnivals? Looking for a fun and creative way to relax with joy doodle happy color art games? Draw sketch at the coloring game, Drawing Carnival, an asmr color page puzzle, create crayola pixel art, draw sketch and joy doodle all rolled into one! With our coloring match and draw-it happy color page features, you can mix and match different art styles to create a unique masterpiece.\r\n\r\nIn this coloring game, you draw sketch! Unlock your inner artist and create a picture made up of different styles in a puzzle. Divide your favorite portrait or any painting into a four part crayola pixel art games puzzle. Spray paint, neon markers, gems, glitter powder... Every kind of painting you can imagine in one of a kind draw sketch art games! \r\n\r\nWith our diverse makeup kit, you can draw it all with different colors and styles to create the perfect happy color look. And for those who are looking to de-stress in a color me happy headspace, our color page ASMR feature is sure to provide a satisfying sensory experience.\r\n\r\nThere are various beautiful images awaiting your joy doodle. Paint freely and relax but also challenge yourself to artistic color puzzles that combine various effects of makeup kit color palettes to create one outstanding work of art. Let's color match and take the colored pens with the right tools, draw different styles, and try to combine them. Put your different pictures together. Give it a try and show me how talented you are! It\u2019s a Drawing Carnival and the show has just begun.\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Join the drawing carnival and let your joy doodle creativity run wild! Color me happy with your beautiful artwork and show off your talent to the world in this color page ASMR coloring game.\r\n\r\nTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our privacy policy: https://crazylabs.com/app",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you a fan of asmr coloring games and crayola pixel art drawing carnivals? Looking for a fun and creative way to relax with joy doodle happy color art games? Draw sketch at the coloring game, Drawing Carnival, an asmr color page puzzle, create crayola pixel art, draw sketch and joy doodle all rolled into one! With our coloring match and draw-it happy color page features, you can mix and match different art styles to create a unique masterpiece.<br><br>In this coloring game, you draw sketch! Unlock your inner artist and create a picture made up of different styles in a puzzle. Divide your favorite portrait or any painting into a four part crayola pixel art games puzzle. Spray paint, neon markers, gems, glitter powder... Every kind of painting you can imagine in one of a kind draw sketch art games! <br><br>With our diverse makeup kit, you can draw it all with different colors and styles to create the perfect happy color look. And for those who are looking to de-stress in a color me happy headspace, our color page ASMR feature is sure to provide a satisfying sensory experience.<br><br>There are various beautiful images awaiting your joy doodle. Paint freely and relax but also challenge yourself to artistic color puzzles that combine various effects of makeup kit color palettes to create one outstanding work of art. Let&#39;s color match and take the colored pens with the right tools, draw different styles, and try to combine them. Put your different pictures together. Give it a try and show me how talented you are! It\u2019s a Drawing Carnival and the show has just begun.<br><br>So what are you waiting for? Join the drawing carnival and let your joy doodle creativity run wild! Color me happy with your beautiful artwork and show off your talent to the world in this color page ASMR coloring game.<br><br>To opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our privacy policy: https://crazylabs.com/app",
